<title>CHINA: Industrial Bank of Korea to set $50 mln FRN.</title>
<headline>Industrial Bank of Korea to set $50 mln FRN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Industrial Bank of Korea has mandated Sanwa International Finance to arrange a one-year U.S. $50 million floating-rate note issue, bankers said.</p>
<p>The issuer is rated A1 by Moody's Investors Service, the same as South Korea's sovereign rating.</p>
<p>No further details were available.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
</text>
